{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415668","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415668","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041566801:1":{"text":"ママ、キキが外で遊びたいって。一緒に行ってもいい？","source_cn":"妈妈，奇奇说想出去玩，我能一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC686DEA39BF93AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566802:1":{"text":"外は危険……いいわ、遊んでらっしゃい。","source_cn":"外面很危险……好吧，你可以出去玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F4CB0A6A21D669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566803:1":{"text":"でも、ちゃんとコートを着ていきなさい。","source_cn":"但你得先穿上外套。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8580A786418499F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566804:1":{"text":"あなたに厚手のコートを縫ったのよ。この前のは刺繍が派手すぎるって言ってたから、今回は一色で統一してみたわ。","source_cn":"妈妈给你缝了一件厚些的，你说过，上次的绣花有些花哨，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF7C50DB19271959","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566805:1":{"text":"でも、袖が少し長すぎたかしら。どう？気に入ってくれた？動きにくくない？","source_cn":"袖子好像做长了一些，你先看看合不合身，样子喜不喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04F1A4CCC3D9B47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566806:1":{"text":"すっごく気に入ったよ。袖もちょうどいいし、ママの作る物は何でも好きだよ！","source_cn":"很好看，袖子也刚刚好。无论妈妈做什么我都喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79142D6E392CBAE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566807:1":{"text":"でもこのコートは一番好き！キキも好きだって言ってるよ。","source_cn":"不过这件我格外喜欢——奇奇也喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE241474D193B6030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566808:1":{"text":"なら、今度キキにも作ってあげましょう。どんなのがいいかしら、スカート？","source_cn":"那下次妈妈也给奇奇做一件吧？要做怎样的，裙子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1BB83A5201A1754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566809:1":{"text":"ううん、キキはパパみたいなローブがいいんだって。","source_cn":"不行，奇奇想穿爸爸那样的袍子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD3423EF9771229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566810:1":{"text":"あら、それで思い出したわ。そろそろニルにも新しい服を作ってあげないと。","source_cn":"啊，这倒提醒我了，也要给尼汝缝两件新衣服了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E626AF257E02CE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566811:1":{"text":"ママも新しいドレスを着ようよ！あのね……パパがこっそりママのために用意してるのを見たんだ。","source_cn":"妈妈，你也需要一条新裙子——我看到了哦，爸爸偷偷给你准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02B432BAEA74DABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566812:1":{"text":"今度、みんなで新しいお洋服を着てお出かけしよう！","source_cn":"过几天，我们一起穿着新衣服出门吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F719EDB8132877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:戴蒙":{"text":"ダイモン","source":"戴蒙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"シェミーラ","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}